-- Demo project only. Universal seed content used to bootstrap each
-- visitor's sandbox. Adapted from the testing playground workspace
-- (infra/seeds/testing_playground_*.sql), so the timeline tells a
-- coherent product-team story (13 projects, ~50 tasks across past /
-- in-flight / future, ~50 milestones).
--
-- Date contract: every date below is written as an absolute date
-- relative to the anchor 2026-04-24, then converted to an offset (in
-- days) at insert time via the date_anchor CTE. seed_demo_workspace()
-- later resolves those offsets to real dates against the visitor's
-- current_date — so the visitor always sees ±2 months around "today".
--
-- All template UUIDs are deterministic (00000000-prefix patterns) so
-- this file is idempotent: re-running ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING keeps
-- content stable.

